  "_note": "A synonym map for the query-expansion measurement — the mechanical stand-in for the rephrasing step of the recall workflow. Authored from the QUESTION SET and ordinary English/domain synonymy, never by reading corpus.ndjson. READ THAT LIMIT HONESTLY: the question set pairs each reworded question with an original-vocabulary twin that itself restates the planted record, so authoring from the questions hands over much of the corpus vocabulary even though the corpus was never opened. This map is therefore NOT blind, and the score it produces is not a floor for what a blind expander would achieve — it is evidence of direction, and the printed report says so. It is committed so a reader can judge that trade for themselves. It is NOT part of the sealed set (the seal covers the corpus, the questions, the bar and the old-path baseline), because it belongs to the measurement, not to the frozen ground truth.",
